---
// El cierre invierte el tema y conserva la firma MICH. a todo el ancho.
---
<footer id="contacto" class="mega-footer">
  <div class="footer-shell">
    <div class="footer-topline">
      <p class="footer-eyebrow">Una idea puede ser el comienzo</p>
      <p class="footer-availability"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>Disponible para proyectos</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-intro">
      <h2>Tu próxima idea.<br /><span>Hagámosla funcionar.</span></h2>
      <p>Diseño, ingeniería e IA para convertir un problema en un producto claro, útil y bien construido.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="footer-contact" href="mailto:mich.ia@hotmail.com?subject=Tengo%20una%20idea%20para%20un%20proyecto&amp;body=Hola%20Mich%2C%0A%0AQuiero%20contarte%20una%20idea%3A%0A%0AEl%20problema%20que%20me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20resolver%20es%E2%80%A6%0A%0ALo%20que%20tengo%20en%20mente%20es%E2%80%A6%0A%0A%C2%BFPodemos%20conversar%3F">
      <span class="contact-label">Empecemos por una conversación</span>
      <span class="contact-title">Cuéntame tu idea</span>
      <span class="contact-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" /></svg></span>
    </a>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Explora el sitio">
        <span class="footer-eyebrow">Explora</span>
        <a href="/#inicio">Inicio</a><a href="/#proyectos">Proyectos</a><a href="/#yo">Sobre mí</a>
      </nav>
      <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Perfil y redes">
        <span class="footer-eyebrow">Encuéntrame</span>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/michelle-rodriguez-lara/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a href="https://github.com/MichelleeLara" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a href="/pdf/CV_michelle_lara.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CV <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </nav>
      <div class="footer-signoff"><p>Mich Rodriguez</p><span>Software Engineer</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-meta"><span>© 2026 Mich Rodriguez</span><span>Diseño + ingeniería + IA</span></div>
  </div>
	<svg
		class="mich-fill block w-full select-none"
		viewBox="0 0 1000 250"
		preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMax meet"
		aria-hidden="true"
	>
		<defs>
			<linearGradient id="michGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
				<stop offset="0" stop-color="var(--mich-top)" />
				<stop offset="1" stop-color="var(--mich-bottom)" />
			</linearGradient>
		</defs>
		<text
			x="500"
			y="250"
			text-anchor="middle"
			textLength="1000"
			lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs"
			fill="url(#michGrad)"
			style="font-family:'Inter Tight Variable',sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:340px;"
		>MICH.</text>
	</svg>
</footer>
<style>
  .mega-footer { --footer-bg: #111112; --footer-ink: #f4f4f2; --footer-muted: #b0b0b4; --footer-line: rgba(255,255,255,.2); --footer-accent: #efaa85; position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding-top: 56px; scroll-margin-top: 96px; border-radius: 48px 48px 0 0; background: var(--footer-bg); color: var(--footer-ink); }
  :global(html.dark) .mega-footer { --footer-bg: #f3f3f1; --footer-ink: #1b1b1d; --footer-muted: #63636b; --footer-line: rgba(0,0,0,.18); --footer-accent: #a74316; }
  .footer-shell { max-width: 1152px; padding: 0 24px; margin: auto; }
  .footer-topline { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; }
  .footer-eyebrow { color: var(--footer-muted); font-family: monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .footer-availability { display: inline-flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; font-size: 11px; color: var(--footer-muted); }
  .footer-availability > span { width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--footer-accent); }
  .footer-intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.7fr 1fr; align-items: end; gap: 64px; margin: 44px 0 48px; }
  .footer-intro h2 { font-family: ClashDisplay, 'Inter Tight Variable', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(36px, 5.4vw, 68px); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  .footer-intro h2 span { color: var(--footer-muted); }
  .footer-intro > p { max-width: 260px; padding-bottom: 3px; color: var(--footer-muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.75; }
  .footer-contact { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.7fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--footer-line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--footer-line); padding: 24px 0; }
  .contact-label { color: var(--footer-muted); max-width: 150px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .contact-title { font-family: ClashDisplay, 'Inter Tight Variable', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 38px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  .contact-arrow { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 60px; height: 60px; border: 1px solid var(--footer-line); border-radius: 50%; color: var(--footer-accent); transition: color 150ms, background-color 150ms, border-color 150ms; }
  .contact-arrow svg { width: 25px; height: 25px; }
  .footer-bottom { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; margin: 32px 0 44px; }
  .footer-nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-content: start; gap: 4px 18px; }
  .footer-nav > .footer-eyebrow { flex-basis: 100%; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .footer-nav a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; min-height: 44px; font-size: 13px; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 5px; }
  .footer-nav a > span { color: var(--footer-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .footer-signoff { text-align: right; font-size: 14px; padding-top: 2px; }
  .footer-signoff > span { display: block; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--footer-muted); }
  .footer-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--footer-muted); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .mega-footer a:focus-visible { outline-color: var(--footer-accent); outline-offset: 5px; }
  .mich-fill { display: block; width: 100%; user-select: none; --mich-top: #00000000; --mich-bottom: #ededf04d; }
  :global(html.dark) .mich-fill { --mich-top: #ffffff00; --mich-bottom: #202024bd; }
  @media (hover: hover) {
    .footer-contact:hover .contact-arrow { background: var(--footer-ink); border-color: var(--footer-ink); color: var(--footer-bg); }
    .footer-nav a:hover { text-decoration-line: underline; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .contact-arrow svg { transition: transform 150ms ease-out; }
    .footer-contact:active .contact-arrow svg { transform: scale(.96); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .mega-footer { border-radius: 28px 28px 0 0; padding-top: 32px; }
    .footer-topline { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
    .footer-intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; margin: 32px 0; }
    .footer-intro > p { max-width: 340px; }
    .footer-contact { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 16px; padding: 20px 0; }
    .contact-label { grid-column: 1 / -1; max-width: none; }
    .contact-title { font-size: clamp(23px, 6vw, 32px); }
    .contact-arrow { width: 48px; height: 48px; }
    .contact-arrow svg { width: 21px; height: 21px; }
    .footer-bottom { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; margin: 24px 0 32px; }
    .footer-nav { flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
    .footer-nav > .footer-eyebrow { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .footer-signoff { display: none; }
    .footer-meta { font-size: 9px; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  }
</style>
